{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Void Corridors</strong> is a first-person puzzle horror game where you navigate maze-like environments, solve intricate puzzles, and manage limited resources to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for energy to keep your flashlight powered and maintain the generator that lights the corridors. Every second of illumination matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Solving</strong> \u2013 Tackle a variety of environmental puzzles to unlock new areas, uncover hidden secrets, and descend deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeaa <strong>Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Traverse dark, shifting hallways filled with an eerie glow. Stay vigilant\u2014at times, it may feel as if the walls themselves are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Psychological Horror</strong> \u2013 The deeper you go, the stronger the sense of being observed becomes. Unravel the mystery behind the corridors before the presence lurking in the shadows finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or become lost in the void?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Voltage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/ec2bba7c0e92976bdd63db0cfef54fb5dfbcd333.jpg"},{"name":"Lost & Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/5b5984a2fd8192c848da011363bb4a5a22eccc68.jpg"},{"name":"Data Transfer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/b8d0320c2acb479d00138c64dcdf72a20430d254.jpg"},{"name":"In Plain Sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3504960/3cd55433a3a7d324b2e3272a5b7dc032a311c208.jpg"},{"name":"Fixed Gaze",